===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|markaðr|lang=non}}, {{term|marknaðr||market|lang=non}}, from northern {{etyl|fro|is}} {{term|market|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|fro|is}} {{term|marchié|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|is}} {{term|mercatus|mercātus|market|lang=la}}. Cognate with {{etyl|fo|-}} {{term|marknaður|lang=fo}}, Danish and Norwegian ''[[marked]]'', Swedish ''[[marknad]]''.

